#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>LibreOffice</application> is a full-featured office suite.  It "
"is largely compatible with <application>Microsoft Office</application> and "
"is descended from <application>OpenOffice.org</application>."
msgstr ""
"<application>LibreOffice</application> é uma suíte de escritório completa. É"
" amplamente compatível com o <application>Microsoft Office</application> e é"
" descendente do <application>OpenOffice.org</application>."

