#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:329
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are many optional dependencies not listed here. They can be found in "
"the <filename>download.lst</filename> file in the sources directory."
msgstr ""
"Existem muitas dependências opcionais não listadas aqui. Elas podem ser "
"encontrados no arquivo <filename>download.lst</filename> no diretório do "
"fonte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:335
#, xml-text
msgid "Editor Notes: <ulink url=\"&blfs-wiki;/libreoffice\"/>"
msgstr "Observações de Editor(a): <ulink url=\"&blfs-wiki;/libreoffice\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:340
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of LibreOffice"
msgstr "Instalação do LibreOffice"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:366
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, fix a build failure with libxml2 and a bug with linking to zlib:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, corrija uma falha de construção com libxml2 e um defeito com "
"vinculação para zlib:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:369
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../libreoffice-&libreoffice-"
"dlversion;-consolidated_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../libreoffice-&libreoffice-"
"dlversion;-consolidated_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:372
#, xml-text
msgid "Next, fix a build failure with ICU-74+:"
msgstr "Em seguida, corrija uma falha de construção com ICU-74+:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:375
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e /LBCM/d -i "
"i18npool/source/breakiterator/data/line.txt</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e /LBCM/d -i "
"i18npool/source/breakiterator/data/line.txt</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:378
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have downloaded the dictionaries, help and translations tarballs, "
"create symlinks to them from the source directory so they won't get "
"downloaded again:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver baixado os tarballs de dicionários, ajuda e de traduções, crie"
" links simbólicos para eles a partir do diretório do fonte, de forma que não"
" sejam baixados novamente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:383
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -dm755 external/tarballs &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-dictionaries-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz external/tarballs/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-help-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz         external/tarballs/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-translations-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz external/tarballs/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -dm755 external/tarballs &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-dictionaries-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz external/tarballs/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-help-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz         external/tarballs/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv ../../../libreoffice-translations-&libreoffice-dlversion;.tar.xz external/tarballs/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:389
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The instructions in the package unpack some tarballs into a location it "
"cannot find later.  Create some symlinks to help the build system out:"
msgstr ""
"As instruções no pacote desempacotam alguns tarballs em um local que não "
"pode ser encontrado posteriormente. Crie alguns links simbólicos para ajudar"
" o sistema de construção:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:393
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -sv src/libreoffice-help-&libreoffice-dlversion;/helpcontent2/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv src/libreoffice-dictionaries-&libreoffice-dlversion;/dictionaries/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv src/libreoffice-translations-&libreoffice-dlversion;/translations/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -sv src/libreoffice-help-&libreoffice-dlversion;/helpcontent2/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv src/libreoffice-dictionaries-&libreoffice-dlversion;/dictionaries/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sv src/libreoffice-translations-&libreoffice-dlversion;/translations/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:399
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"During the build process, some packages will be downloaded (including the "
"ones listed as recommended and optional dependencies) if they are not "
"present on the system. Because of this, build time may vary from the "
"published time more than usual."
msgstr ""
"Durante o processo de construção, alguns pacotes serão baixados (incluindo "
"aqueles listados como dependências recomendadas e opcionais) se eles não "
"estiverem presentes no sistema. Por causa disso, o tempo de construção "
"possivelmente varie do horário publicado mais que o normal."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:407
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Due to the large size of the package, you may prefer to install it in "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename>, instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>. Depending on your choice, replace "
"<replaceable>&lt;PREFIX&gt;</replaceable> by <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> or by <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/libreoffice-&libreoffice-dlversion;</filename>:"
msgstr ""
"Devido ao grande tamanho do pacote, você possivelmente prefira instalá-lo em"
" <filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename>, em vez de <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>. Dependendo da tua escolha, substitua "
"<replaceable>&lt;PREFIX&gt;</replaceable> por <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> ou por <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/libreoffice-&libreoffice-dlversion;</filename>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:415
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>export "
"LO_PREFIX=<replaceable>&lt;PREFIX&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>export "
"LO_PREFIX=<replaceable>&lt;PREFIXO&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:418
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Locales \"fr\" and \"en-GB\", you will find below, are just examples; you "
"should change them to suit your needs - you might want to read the \"Command"
" Explanations\", further below, before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"Os locais \"fr\" e \"en-GB\", que você encontrará abaixo, são apenas "
"exemplos; você deveria mudá-los para atender às tuas necessidades - você "
"pode querer ler as \"Explicações do Comando\", mais abaixo, antes de "
"continuar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:425
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you set the ACLOCAL environment variable to support installing Xorg in "
"/opt, you will need to unset it for this package."
msgstr ""
"Se você configurou a variável de ambiente ACLOCAL para suportar a instalação"
" do Xorg em /opt, você precisará desconfigurá-la para esse pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:431
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are building on a 32 bit machine, <envar>CFLAGS</envar> is set to "
"<command>-Os</command>, which breaks the build. Prevent this by issuing:"
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver construir em uma máquina de 32 bits, <envar>CFLAGS</envar> "
"está configurada como <command>-Os</command>, o que quebra a construção. "
"Evite isso emitindo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:436
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>case $(uname -m) in\n"
"   i?86) sed /-Os/d -i solenv/gbuild/platform/LINUX_INTEL_GCC.mk ;;\n"
"esac</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>case $(uname -m) in\n"
"   i?86) sed /-Os/d -i solenv/gbuild/platform/LINUX_INTEL_GCC.mk ;;\n"
"esac</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:441
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Prepare <application>LibreOffice</application> for compilation by running "
"the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Prepare o <application>LibreOffice</application> para compilação executando "
"os seguintes comandos:"

#. Editors: if it happens you need to remove some "with-system-xxx"
#.     instruction because libreoffice temporarily cannot use the current
#.     system version, please keep it around commented out, so that it can be
#.     remembered to test it with higher versions of libreoffice.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/libreoffice.xml:450
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"/gzip -f/d\"   \\\n"
"    -e \"s|.1.gz|.1|g\" \\\n"
"    -i bin/distro-install-desktop-integration &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"/distro-install-file-lists/d\" -i Makefile.in &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./autogen.sh --prefix=$LO_PREFIX         \\\n"
"             --sysconfdir=/etc           \\\n"
"             --with-vendor=BLFS          \\\n"
"             --with-lang='fr en-GB'      \\\n"
"             --with-help                 \\\n"
"             --with-myspell-dicts        \\\n"
"             --without-junit             \\\n"
"             --without-system-dicts      \\\n"
"             --disable-dconf             \\\n"
"             --disable-odk               \\\n"
"             --enable-release-build=yes  \\\n"
"             --enable-python=system      \\\n"
"             --with-jdk-home=/opt/jdk    \\\n"
"             --with-system-boost         \\\n"
"             --with-system-clucene       \\\n"
"             --with-system-curl          \\\n"
"             --with-system-epoxy         \\\n"
"             --with-system-expat         \\\n"
"             --with-system-glm           \\\n"
"             --with-system-gpgmepp       \\\n"
"             --with-system-graphite      \\\n"
"             --with-system-harfbuzz      \\\n"
"             --with-system-icu           \\\n"
"             --with-system-jpeg          \\\n"
"             --with-system-lcms2         \\\n"
"             --with-system-libatomic_ops \\\n"
"             --with-system-libpng        \\\n"
"             --with-system-libxml        \\\n"
"             --with-system-nss           \\\n"
"             --with-system-odbc          \\\n"
"             --with-system-openldap      \\\n"
"             --with-system-openssl       \\\n"
"             --with-system-poppler       \\\n"
"             --with-system-postgresql    \\\n"
"             --with-system-redland       \\\n"
"             --with-system-libtiff       \\\n"
"             --with-system-libwebp       \\\n"
"             --with-system-zlib</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"/gzip -f/d\"   \\\n"
"    -e \"s|.1.gz|.1|g\" \\\n"
"    -i bin/distro-install-desktop-integration &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
